{
  "id": 206730889,
  "iid": 9842,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "RSVP: Add missing S2L_SUB_LSP filter.",
  "description": "There was a filter missing for `rsvp.s2l_sub_lsp` with the side effect of json not showing it as a key and showing `rsvp.obj_unknown` instead.\n\nAdd the filter, now it works:\n```\n% ./run/tshark -r ../capture_12.pcap rsvp.s2l_sub_lsp\n    1   0.000000 172.16.11.11 → 172.16.22.22 RSVP 318 PATH Message. SESSION: IPv4-P2MP LSP TUNNEL, P2MP ID 2886732555, Tunnel ID 55558, Ext Tunnel 172.16.11.11. SENDER TEMPLATE: P2MP_LSP_TUNNEL_IPv4, IPv4 tunnel sender address 172.16.11.11, LSP ID: 1, Sub-Group ID 1. \n[...]\n```\n... and now json contains the key ...\n```\n% ./run/tshark -r ../capture_12.pcap -T json \n[...]\n         \"rsvp.s2l_sub_lsp\": {\n            \"rsvp.length\": \"8\",\n            \"rsvp.object\": \"50\",\n            \"rsvp.ctype\": \"1\",\n            \"rsvp.ctype.s2l_sub_lsp\": \"1\",\n            \"rsvp.s2l_sub_lsp.destination_ipv4_address\": \"172.16.22.22\"\n          }\n[...]\n```\nIssue #18866",
  "state": "merged",
